    "text": "As <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Squaring both the sides&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60°</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> Angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>|</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo stretchy=\"t